# Local experiment evidence (Phase 0/1 exploration output). Contains captured agent sessions,
# absolute machine paths in recorded git state, and measured outputs whose values are the point.
# Redacting them would rewrite measurements, so the tree stays local; the conclusions live in
# docs/architecture/ and experiments/*/README.md.
experiments/

# Validation evidence tree. The reports, capture manifests and freeze manifests are tracked; the raw
# agent session transcripts are not. Those are 29 files / ~59 MB, duplicated across experiment rounds,
# and they are the attested INPUTS of the freeze manifests — redacting them would invalidate those
# hashes, so they stay local and their hashes stay original.
#
# Everything tracked here was redacted on 2026-09-26: home and repository paths were replaced with
# placeholders. Each manifest records that pass, so the hashes it carries attest the committed
# artifacts rather than the originals.
docs/validation/**/*.jsonl

# The earlier blanket exclusion of docs/validation/ is gone: the tree has been redacted, so it is
# tracked. The accepted baseline reports under docs/validation/*.md were always tracked.
